sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant W as Web App
  participant API
  participant DB as Database
  participant PSP as Payment Provider

  U->>W: Open cart
  activate W
  W->>API: POST /orders
  activate API
  API->>API: Validate stock
  API->>+DB: INSERT order
  DB-->>-API: order_id
  Note right of DB: Row locked until commit
  Note left of U: Guest checkout
  Note over API,PSP: Idempotency key required
  Note over W,API: Two lines of text<br/>stay two lines

  loop Retry up to 3 times
    API-)PSP: Charge card
    PSP--)API: pending
  end

  alt payment succeeded
    PSP-->>API: success
    opt Send receipt
      API->>W: Receipt link
    end
  else payment failed
    PSP-->>API: declined
    loop Every minute
      API-xW: Retry notice
    end
  end

  par Notify customer
    API->>U: Email confirmation
  and Update stock
    API->>DB: UPDATE stock
  and Audit
    API->>W: Audit ping
  end

  critical Capture funds
    API->>PSP: Capture
  option Timeout
    API-->>W: Capture delayed
  option Network error
    API-->>W: Capture failed
  end

  break Customer cancelled
    API->>W: Cancel order
  end

  rect rgb(40, 60, 90)
    W->>U: Show summary
    Note over U,W: Highlighted section
  end
  deactivate API
  deactivate W
